  Lemma seg_H : ltac2:(zQ "ia2!j7!q0!ip7!ik2!h8!jj5!ihf!mva!ir6!iqa!nn6!ku3!iv9!hif!lra!jme!jk8!ir0!ipf!q5!ll8!nrb!nv2!nvb!oi9!oj2!qq8!qr7!qrf!oq2!oqe!or6!ov8!pk4!qs7!pl0!qt1!pla!qt6!pu4!puf!llf&@1$7@2$2@1$1@1$0#8?4path&@2$f@2$h0@1$0#k0?3sp0+ijf>4vals@1$4@1$1@1$0#k0>1R@2$h8@1$0#5@1$1@1$0#k0>1M>0@1$1@1$0#k0@1$8@1$1@1$0#8>3msF$a>2mo$h6>0@2$h4@2$eZ~0@2$e~0+je>0@3$3$h2@2$2@1$1@1$0#k0^6Nhg3>0@3$3@1$1@1$0#k0@2$d^7N0?3sp0>0@3$3@1$1@1$0#k0@2$d^8Nod@2$6@1$0#k0~0>0@3$i8@1$b^9$hc^8>0@4$i7$5@1$b^a^8$hb>0@3$h9^8^7^9>0@3$3$a@3$hd?1L?1S^9@5$he?2fx^b@2$6@1$0#k0$ha^a@1$hf$5>0@3$3@1$8@1$4@1$1@1$0#8@4$c$5^b@2$6@1$0#k0~1@2$2@1$1@1$0#8?4path@2$9@1$4@1$1@1$0#8?4path>0@3$3@1$8@1$4@1$1@1$0#8@4$c$5^c@2$6@1$0#k0@2$i9~1~0N1@2$9@1$4@1$1@1$0#8@3$h1@1$1@1$0#8@2$6@1$0#8+a@1$h3@1$1@1$0#8@4$i1$5$i0@2$h5^c^b@2$i2@2$i4+2@1$i6?4path@2$i3@1$i5+2@1$h7?3mo0").
  Proof.
    intros vals R M msF mo HP HL P0 P141 HR HK [OK SB FM] RS SBp SBn.
